\reserved@a ->\@nil

l.13250 ... expression/\linebreak[0]communication}
                                                   jbobau, place 3

Seems LaTeX doesn't like "Lojban expression/communication" as the
3rd place keyword for jbobau.

Had to go into the database manually for that one.

